# VHS tape for the four design systems at block size

Output examples/vhs/02b_designs_block.gif

Set FontSize 20
Set Width 1200
Set Height 820
Set Padding 0
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"

Hide
Type "clear && cargo run --release --example checkbox_designs"
Enter
Sleep 5s
Type "s"
Sleep 1s
Show
Sleep 2s

Down
Sleep 0.6s
Space
Sleep 1.2s
Space
Sleep 1.2s
Type "r"
Sleep 2s

Hide
Type "q"
Sleep 0.3s
